3 (or 4)); "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" the remaining student 4 (or student 3), must shake one student's hand ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a3 = a4 = 1"},{"kind":"text","text":") but it is impossible as there are only two scenarios: either a team formed and he doesn't greet anyone, or he greets all the three present people who work individually. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"D","problemCode":"534D","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/534/problem/D"}